e absolutely no idea why he saved it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":253},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: That's what we're trying to figure out."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":254},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-6"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Doesn't that seem a little convenient to anyone else?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":255},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Convenient for who?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":256},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-8"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I don't know, Maya."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":257},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-9"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That's the problem."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":258},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-11"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Maybe he saved the wrong number."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":259},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-12"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Possible."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":260},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-13"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Sure."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":261},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-14"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: And maybe this is all one big misunderstanding."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":262},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-15"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: It could be."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":263},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-16"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: You don't actually believe that."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":264},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-17"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I believe we don't have enough information."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":265},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-19"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Fine."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":266},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-20"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Let's ask something else."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":267},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-21"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Lucas, don't start."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":268},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-22"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: It's a question, Sophie."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":269},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-23"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Where were you three nights ago?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":270},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-24"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Oh, come on."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":271},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-25"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Lucas!"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":272},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-26"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: What?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":273},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-27"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: We don't know anything about this person."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":274},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-28"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: And you think asking for an alibi is going to help?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":275},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-29"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: It might."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":276},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C03-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: See?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":277},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C03-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Already being di