t even agree about what happened that night."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":466},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-22"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Maya."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":467},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-23"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: What?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":468},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-24"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Don't."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":469},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-26"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: She's right."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":470},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-27"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: ..."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":471},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-28"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: We keep acting like we have all these answers."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":472},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-29"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: But we don't."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":473},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-30"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Can we please not do this right now?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":474},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-31"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I'm not trying to start anything."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":475},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-32"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I'm just saying we need to stop mixing up what we know and what we think we know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":476},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-33"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Exactly."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":477},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-35"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Okay."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":478},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-36"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: You're right."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":479},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-08-37"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Both of you."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":480},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C09-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: That's what we're trying to establish."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":481},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C09-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Which is why we shouldn't be discussing it with someone we just met."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":482},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C09-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Lucas has a point."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":483},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C09-a-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Sorry."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":484},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C09-a-6"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I know that's frustrating."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":485},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Maya?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":486},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Sorry."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":487},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Wrong chat."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":488},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-6"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: What did you delete?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":489},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: A message meant for someone else."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":490},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-8"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: About what?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":491},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-9"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Something unrelated."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":492},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-10"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Right."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":493},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-11"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Lucas."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":494},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-12"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: What?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":495},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-13"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Please don't make something out of nothing."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":496},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-15"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: You know what bothers me the most?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":497},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-16"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: What?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":498},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-17"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: We keep saying we trust each other."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":499},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-18"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: But the moment something goes wrong, suddenly everyone has something they don't want to explain."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":500},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-19"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: That's not fair."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":501},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-20"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Isn't it?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":502},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-21"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: What are you trying to say?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":503},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-22"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I'm saying maybe we should stop pretending everything's fine."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":504},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-23"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Nobody's pretending everything's fine."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":505},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-24"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then why does it feel like I'm the only one asking the obvious questions?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":506},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-25"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: You're not."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":507},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-26"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Really?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":508},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-27"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Really."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":509},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-28"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then answer this."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":510},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-30"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Why does Daniel have a stranger's number saved without a name?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":511},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-31"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I don't know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":512},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-32"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Who marked it with a star?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":513},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-33"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I don't know!"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":514},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-34"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Why has nobody heard from him?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":515},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-35"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: LUCAS!"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":516},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-37"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Stop."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":517},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-09-38"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Both of you."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":518},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C10-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Exactly."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":519},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C10-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then maybe we shouldn't be acting like we do."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":520},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C10-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I'm not!"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":521},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C10-a-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then stop making decisions for everyone."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":522},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Fine."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":523},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Maybe adding someone was a mistake."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":524},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: But I still think ignoring the number would've been worse."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":525},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That's your opinion."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":526},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-6"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Yes."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":527},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: It is."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":528},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-9"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Nobody has to decide everything right now."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":529},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-10"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: No."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":530},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-11"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: But we do have to decide what we're willing to risk."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":531},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-12"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: What does that mean?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":532},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-13"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: It means I'm not comfortable with this anymore."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":533},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-14"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: With what?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":534},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-15"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: With how we're handling everything."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":535},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-16"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Lucas..."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":536},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-17"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: No, Sophie."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":537},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-18"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I've been trying to say this for days."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":538},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-19"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Every time I question something, you act like I'm making things harder."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":539},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-20"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Because sometimes you are!"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":540},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-22"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: ..."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":541},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-23"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Sophie."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":542},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-24"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I'm sorry."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":543},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-25"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I didn't mean—"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":544},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-26"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: No."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":545},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-27"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: You did."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":546},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-29"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Lucas, please."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":547},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-30"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I'm not doing this."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":548},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-31"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Don't be dramatic."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":549},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-32"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I'm not being dramatic."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":550},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-33"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I'm stepping away before I say something I regret."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":551},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-34"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: We're all upset."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":552},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-35"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That's not the point."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":553},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-36"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Then what is?"}},{"k":"rea