t to be kidding me."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":227},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-OPENING-19"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Lucas, please."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":228},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-OPENING-20"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Please what?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":229},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-OPENING-21"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: We don't even know who this is."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":230},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-OPENING-22"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Can we just calm down for a second?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":231},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-OPENING-23"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I'm calm."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":232},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-OPENING-24"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: You're really not."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":233},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-OPENING-25"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Fine."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":234},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-OPENING-26"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then maybe our new guest would like to explain why they're here."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":235},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C01-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Great."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":236},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C01-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That makes two of us."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":237},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C01-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: At least they're being honest."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":238},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C01-a-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Or they know how to sound honest."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":239},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C01-a-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Lucas."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":240},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C01-a-6"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: What?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":241},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C01-a-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I'm allowed to have questions."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":242},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-01-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Alright."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":243},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-01-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Let's start with something simple."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":244},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-01-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Do you know Daniel?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":245},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C02-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then why was your number saved?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":246},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C02-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Fair enough."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":247},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C02-a-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: See? That's why I added them."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":248},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C02-a-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That doesn't answer anything."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":249},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: So let me get this straight."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":250},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Daniel had your number."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":251},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: You don't know Daniel."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":252},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: And you have absolutely no idea why he saved it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":253},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: That's what we're trying to figure out."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":254},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-6"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Doesn't that seem a little convenient to anyone else?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":255},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Convenient for who?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":256},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-8"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I don't know, Maya."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":257},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-9"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That's the problem."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":258},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-11"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Maybe he saved the wrong number."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":259},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-12"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Possible."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":260},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-13"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Sure."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":261},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-14"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: And maybe this is all one big misunderstanding."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":262},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-15"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: It could be."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":263},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-16"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: You don't actually believe that."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":264},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-02-17"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL 